            <ui:InvokeCode ContinueOnError="{x:Null}" Code="// Step 2: Insert transformed unmatched dtPostedTransactionDetailsMatched rows into dtHistoricalReconTransactionsReportMatched&#xA;foreach (DataRow row in dtTransactionReportMatched.Rows)&#xA;{&#xA;    // Create a new row&#xA;    DataRow newRow = dtHistoricalReconTransactionsReportMatched.NewRow();&#xA;&#xA;    // Calculate Excel row number assuming header is row 1&#xA;    int reportRowNumber = dtHistoricalReconTransactionsReportMatched.Rows.Count + 2;&#xA;&#xA;    // Map and transform values&#xA;    string[] formats = { &quot;dd/MM/yyyy HH:mm:ss&quot;, &quot;M/d/yyyy HH:mm:ss&quot;, &quot;MM/dd/yyyy HH:mm:ss&quot; };&#xA;&#xA;    // Parse Booking Date&#xA;    string bookingDateRaw = row[&quot;Transaction Date&quot;].ToString();&#xA;    if (DateTime.TryParseExact(bookingDateRaw, formats, System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture, System.Globalization.DateTimeStyles.None, out DateTime parsedBookingDate))&#xA;        newRow[&quot;Booking Date&quot;] = parsedBookingDate;&#xA;    else&#xA;        newRow[&quot;Booking Date&quot;] = DBNull.Value;&#xA;&#xA;    // Parse Value Date&#xA;    string valueDateRaw = row[&quot;Value Date&quot;].ToString();&#xA;    if (DateTime.TryParseExact(valueDateRaw, formats, System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture, System.Globalization.DateTimeStyles.None, out DateTime parsedValueDate))&#xA;        newRow[&quot;Value Date&quot;] = parsedValueDate;&#xA;    else&#xA;        newRow[&quot;Value Date&quot;] = DBNull.Value;&#xA;&#xA;    // Reference and narration&#xA;    newRow[&quot;Transaction Ref No:&quot;] = row[&quot;ARN&quot;];&#xA;&#xA;    // Create and assign &quot;Narration&quot;&#xA;    string narration = $&quot;{row[&quot;Transaction Type&quot;]}-{row[&quot;C_PAN&quot;]} - {row[&quot;STAN&quot;]} - {row[&quot;RRN&quot;]} - {row[&quot;AUTHORIZATION_NUMBER&quot;]}&quot;;&#xA;    newRow[&quot;Narration&quot;] = narration;&#xA;&#x9;    newRow[&quot;C_NARRATION&quot;] = narration;&#xA;    // Assign &quot;Debit&quot; and &quot;Credit&quot;&#xA;// Assign &quot;Debit&quot; and &quot;Credit&quot; based on DR/CR indicator&#xA;string drCr = row[&quot;DR/CR to Cardholder&quot;]?.ToString().Trim().ToUpper();&#xA;&#xA;if (drCr == &quot;DR&quot;)&#xA;{&#xA;    newRow[&quot;Debit (TZS)&quot;] = DBNull.Value;&#xA;    newRow[&quot;Credit (TZS)&quot;] = row[&quot;Billing Amount&quot;];&#xA;}&#xA;else if (drCr == &quot;CR&quot;)&#xA;{&#xA;    newRow[&quot;Debit (TZS)&quot;] = row[&quot;Billing Amount&quot;];&#xA;    newRow[&quot;Credit (TZS)&quot;] = DBNull.Value;&#xA;}&#xA;else&#xA;{&#xA;    newRow[&quot;Debit (TZS)&quot;] = DBNull.Value;&#xA;    newRow[&quot;Credit (TZS)&quot;] = DBNull.Value;&#xA;}&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;    // Additional fields&#xA;    newRow[&quot;STAN&quot;] = row[&quot;STAN&quot;];&#xA;    newRow[&quot;RRN&quot;] = row[&quot;RRN&quot;];&#xA;    //newRow[&quot;EXTRACTED_TERMINAL_ID&quot;] = row[&quot;Terminal ID&quot;];&#xA;    newRow[&quot;AUTHORIZATION_NUMBER&quot;] = row[&quot;AUTHORIZATION_NUMBER&quot;];&#xA;    newRow[&quot;C_PAN&quot;] = row[&quot;C_PAN&quot;];&#xA;&#x9;newRow[&quot;C_PAN_AMOUNT&quot;] = row[&quot;C_PAN_AMOUNT&quot;];&#xA;&#x9;newRow[&quot;source&quot;] = row[&quot;source&quot;];&#xA;    newRow[&quot;Search Key&quot;] = row[&quot;Search Key&quot;];&#xA;&#xA;    // Add row to DataTable&#xA;    dtHistoricalReconTransactionsReportMatched.Rows.Add(newRow);&#xA;}&#xA;&#xA;dtHistoricalReconTransactionsReportMatched.AcceptChanges();&#xA;&#xA;// Log summary&#xA;Console.WriteLine($&quot;MATCHED rows moved: {dtTransactionReportMatched.Rows.Count}&quot;);&#xA;Console.WriteLine($&quot;Total rows in dtHistoricalReconTransactionsReportMatched: {dtHistoricalReconTransactionsReportMatched.Rows.Count}&quot;);&#xA;" DisplayName="copy dtTransactionReportMatched" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="416,196.8" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="InvokeCode_26" Language="CSharp">
